WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.512
Verbs show actions or states. Singular and plural subjects need matching verb forms.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:09.993
Which is a verb in “Kofi carried a basket”? Answer: carried

00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:14.813
Underline each subject and correct its verb in six sentences.

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:17.814
Discuss why: Carried shows an action.
